<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>股票监控分析系统</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/common_style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/analyst_style.css">
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>股票监控分析系统</h1>
        
        <!-- 导航菜单 -->
        <nav class="nav-menu">
            <button class="nav-btn active" data-page="stock-monitor">股票监控</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" data-page="picker">策略选股</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" data-page="valuation">估值报告</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" data-page="analyst-view">分析师数据</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" data-page="index-monitor">指数数据统计</button>
            <button class="nav-btn" data-page="fund-monitor">基金数据统计</button>
        </nav>
        
        <!-- 股票监控页面 -->
        <div id="stock-monitor-page" class="page-content active-page">

            <!-- 股票列表 -->
            <div class="stocks-section">
                <h2>监控股票列表
                    <button id="refresh-all-btn" style="margin-left: 10px; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 10px;">立即查询</button>
                    <button id="toggle-global-notification" class="toggle-btn toggle-on" style="margin-left: 10px; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 10px;" onclick="toggleGlobalNotification()">关闭全部消息</button>
                </h2>
                <div id="stocks-list">
                    <!-- 动态加载股票列表 -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 添加股票表单 -->
            <div class="form-section">
                <h2>添加监控股票</h2>
                <form id="add-stock-form">
                    <div class="form-row">
                        <input type="text" id="stock-name" placeholder="股票名称" required>
                        <input type="text" id="stock-code" placeholder="股票代码" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-row">
                        <input type="number" id="low-price" placeholder="低价报警价格" step="0.01">
                        <input type="number" id="high-price" placeholder="高价报警价格" step="0.01">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-row">
                        <input type="text" id="key-price-alerts" placeholder="关键价位报警 (格式: 价格:类型,如 64:支撑位,66:压力位)">
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="form-row">
                        <input type="text" id="change-pct-alerts" placeholder="涨跌幅报警 (格式: 百分比:类型,如 3:警告,5:警报)">
                    </div>                
                    <div class="form-row">
                        <label>
                            <input type="checkbox" id="limit-alert"> 涨跌停报警
                        </label>
                    </div>
                    
                    <button type="submit">添加股票</button>
                </form>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 市场温度（原为独立页面，现并入本页底部） -->
            <div class="panel" id="market-section">
                <h2 style="margin-bottom:6px;">市场温度
                    <span style="font-size:13px;color:#999;font-weight:normal;">上证综指 · 深证成指 · 创业板指</span>
                </h2>
                <p style="margin:0 0 10px;color:#777;font-size:12px;">
                    指数温度 = <b>50%×PE位 + 50%×PB位</b>（市值加权整体法，近 10 年分位）；位置越低越便宜、越高越贵。
                    数据低频，<b>点「刷新温度」手动计算</b>（首次约 1~3 分钟），结果缓存 1 天。
                </p>
                <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px;">
                    <button id="mt-refresh" type="button" style="padding:6px 14px;">刷新温度</button>
                    <span id="mt-status" style="font-size:13px;color:#333;">空闲</span>
                </div>
                <div id="mt-result"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 策略选股页面 -->
        <div id="picker-page" class="page-content">
            <h2>策略选股 <span style="font-size:14px;color:#999;">多头结构 · 金叉确认 · 回踩确认</span></h2>

            <div style="background:#f7f9fb;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#555;font-size:13px;">
                    规则：<b>A 多头结构</b>(价格&gt;慢线、快&gt;中&gt;慢、快线向上) <b>· B 金叉确认</b>(中线上穿慢线，且在观察窗内)
                    <b>· C 回踩确认</b>(收盘贴近快线且不深破中线、近窗口出现过回踩) ；量能缩量属软条件。
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0;color:#777;font-size:12px;">扫描在后台执行(逐股拉日线行情，数百只需数分钟)，期间可轮询进度；结果自动存入快照便于日后查看表现。</p>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-bottom:14px;align-items:flex-end;">
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                    股票池
                    <select id="pk-pool" style="margin-top:4px;padding:6px;">
                        <option value="hs300">沪深300</option>
                        <option value="zz500">中证500</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                    快线MA(回调支撑)
                    <input id="pk-ma-fast" type="number" value="20" style="margin-top:4px;width:70px;padding:6px;">
                </label>
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                    中线MA(金叉方)
                    <input id="pk-ma-mid" type="number" value="60" style="width:70px;padding:6px;margin-top:4px;">
                </label>
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                    慢线MA(趋势)
                    <input id="pk-ma-slow" type="number" value="200" style="width:90px;padding:6px;margin-top:4px;">
                </label>
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                    金叉观察窗(根)
                    <input id="pk-cross-lookback" type="number" value="120" style="width:80px;padding:6px;margin-top:4px;">
                </label>
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                    现价距快线上限(%)
                    <input id="pk-pullhigh" type="number" value="5.0" step="0.5" style="width:90px;padding:6px;margin-top:4px;">
                </label>
                <fieldset style="border:1px dashed #c9d2dc;border-radius:6px;margin:0;padding:4px 10px 8px;">
                    <legend style="font-size:12px;color:#888;padding:0 4px;">回踩确认带(LOW可触及, 相对快线%)</legend>
                    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;">
                        <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:12px;color:#666;">上浮
                            <input id="pk-touch-above" type="number" value="3.0" step="0.5" style="width:70px;padding:5px;margin-top:3px;">
                        </label>
                        <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:12px;color:#666;">下探
                            <input id="pk-touch-below" type="number" value="1.5" step="0.1" style="width:70px;padding:5px;margin-top:3px;">
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:#666;margin-bottom:8px;">
                    <input id="pk-volume" type="checkbox"> 启用缩量软条件
                </label>
                <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-size:13px;color:#666;margin-bottom:8px;">
                    <input id="pk-force" type="checkbox"> 强制重拉行情(忽略缓存)
                </label>
                <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
                    <button id="pk-run" style="padding:8px 16px;">开始扫描</button>
                    <button id="pk-stop" style="padding:8px 16px;" disabled>停止</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 进度 -->
            <div style="margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
                <div id="pk-status" style="font-size:13px;color:#333;">空闲</div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:8px;background:#eef0f3;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:6px;">
                <div id="pk-bar" style="height:100%;width:0%;background:#1890ff;transition:width .3s;"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- 命中/观察 结果 -->
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;">
                <button id="pk-tab-hit" class="pk-tab active" style="padding:6px 14px;">完整命中</button>
                <button id="pk-tab-part" class="pk-tab" style="padding:6px 14px;">观察(部分命中)</button>
                <button id="pk-tab-hist" class="pk-tab" style="padding:6px 14px;">历史快照</button>
            </div>
            <div style="overflow:auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:6px;">
                <table id="pk-table" class="pk-table" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;">
                    <thead id="pk-thead"></thead>
                    <tbody id="pk-tbody"></tbody>
                </table>
                <div id="pk-empty" style="padding:18px;text-align:center;color:#aaa;">尚未扫描。选择参数后点击“开始扫描”。</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 估值报告页面 -->
        <div id="valuation-page" class="page-content">
            <h2>个股估值报告 <span style="font-size:14px;color:#999;">市赚率 · 盈利调节市净率 · 价格周期</span></h2>

            <div style="background:#f7f9fb;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 4px;color:#555;font-size:13px;">
                    基于 stockdb 本地日K（前复权）计算：<b>估值维度</b>（市赚率 / 盈利调节市净率三口径）+ <b>价格周期</b> + <b>市场背景</b>。
                    报告在后台计算（单股数秒），期间可轮询进度。
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0;color:#777;font-size:12px;">历史位置 = 截至当日的 expanding 位置(0~1)：越低越便宜，越高越贵；10%/90% 为极端区参考。本报告为状态描述，非买卖建议。</p>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-bottom:14px;align-items:flex-end;">
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;">
                    股票池
                    <select id="vl-pool" style="margin-top:4px;padding:6px;">
                        <option value="hs300">沪深300</option>
                        <option value="zz500">中证500</option>
                    </select>
                </label>
                <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px;color:#666;flex:1;min-width:260px;">
                    股票（代码或名称，如 601166 兴业银行）
                    <input id="vl-code" list="vl-stocks" placeholder="输入或选择股票代码" style="margin-top:4px;padding:6px;">
                    <datalist id="vl-stocks"></datalist>
                </label>
                <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;">
                    <button id="vl-run" style="padding:8px 16px;">生成报告</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 进度 -->
            <div style="margin-bottom:14px;">
                <span id="vl-status" style="font-size:13px;color:#333;">空闲</span>
            </div>

            <!-- 报告结果 -->
            <div id="vl-result" style="display:none;">
                <!-- 结论 banner -->
                <div id="vl-conclusion" style="padding:14px 16px;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:14px;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;"></div>

                <!-- 最新读数面板 -->
                <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;">
                    <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;">最新读数面板</h3>
                    <table id="vl-panel-table" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;"></table>
                </div>

                <!-- 四层时序图 -->
                <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;">
                    <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;">四层时序图</h3>
                    <div id="vl-chart" style="width:100%;height:760px;"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- 买卖信号 -->
                <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e9ee;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px;">
                    <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px;">盈利调节买卖信号（主口径）</h3>
                    <div id="vl-signal-stats" style="margin-bottom:10px;"></div>
                    <table id="vl-events-table" style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;"></table>
                    <p id="vl-events-note" style="color:#999;font-size:12px;margin:8px 0 0;"></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 分析师数据页面 -->
        <div id="analyst-view-page" class="page-content">
            <h2>东财分析师数据</h2>

            <!-- 分析师重点关注股票控制面板 -->
            <div class="analyst-controls-top" style="display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 5px;">
                <button id="refresh-analyst-btn">刷新分析师重点关注股票</button>
                <select id="analyst-period-select" title="数据口径：东方财富年度排行（akshare 仅支持年度）">
                    <option value="year" selected>年度收益率排行</option>
                </select>
                <select id="analyst-top-stocks-select">
                    <option value="20">显示前20只重点关注股票</option>
                    <option value="50" selected>显示前50只重点关注股票</option>
                    <option value="100">显示前100重点关注只股票</option>
                    <option value="all">显示全部股票</option>
                </select>
                <select id="analyst-top-analysts-select">
                    <option value="20">基于前20名分析师跟踪数据</option>
                    <option value="50" selected>基于前50名分析师跟踪数据</option>
                    <option value="100">基于前100名分析师跟踪数据</option>
                    <option value="all">基于全部分析师跟踪数据</option>
                </select>
                <span style="color:#888;font-size:13px;">口径：东方财富<b>年度排行</b>（前100名）</span>
            </div>

            <!-- 分析师重点关注股票数据区域 -->
            <div class="analyst-split-layout">
                <div class="analyst-data-panel">
                    <h3>分析师重点关注股票</h3>
                    <div id="analyst-focus-stocks-container">
                        <p>点击上方按钮加载分析师重点关注股票数据...</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 分析师最新跟踪股票控制面板 -->
            <div class="analyst-controls-bottom" style="display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f0f8f0; border-radius: 5px;">
                <button id="refresh-recently-updated-btn">刷新分析师最新跟踪股票</button>
                <input type="number" id="date-threshold-input" value="30" min="1" max="120" style="width: 60px; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px;">
                <span>天内更新的股票</span>
            </div>

            <!-- 分析师最新跟踪股票数据区域 -->
            <div class="analyst-split-layout">
                <div class="analyst-data-panel">
                    <h3>分析师最新跟踪股票</h3>
                    <div id="analyst-latest-tracking-container">
                        <p>点击上方按钮加载分析师最新跟踪股票数据...</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- 指数统计页面 -->
        <div id="index-monitor-page" class="page-content">
            <h2>指数数据统计</h2>

            <!-- 指数排名控制 -->
            <div class="index-controls-top" style="display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 15px; background-color: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 5px;">
                <button id="refresh-index-ranking" style="padding: 8px 12px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px; background: white; cursor: pointer;">刷新指数排名</button>
                <select id="index-period-select" style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <option value="1">最近1天</option>
                    <option value="5">最近5天</option>
                    <option value="10">最近10天</option>
                    <option value="20">最近20天</option>
                    <option value="30" selected>最近30天</option>
                    <option value="60">最近60天</option>
                    <option value="90">最近90天</option>
                    <option value="240">最近240天</option>
                    <option value="360">最近360天</option>
                </select>
                <select id="top-n-index" style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px;">
                    <option value="10">显示前10个</option>
                    <option value="28" selected>显示前28个</option>
                    <option value="40">显示前40个</option>
                    <option value="50">显示前50个</option>
                    <option value="100">显示前100个</option>
                    <option value="all">显示所有指数</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div id="index-ranking-container">
                <p>点击上方按钮加载指数数据...</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 指数对比图表 -->
            <h2>指数走势对比图（最近30天前28名）</h2>
            
            <!-- 指数选择区域 -->
            <div class="index-chart-controls">
                <div class="control-section">
                    <h3>选择指数（最多10个）：</h3>
                    <div id="index-checkboxes" class="checkboxes-grid">
                        <!-- 动态加载指数复选框 -->
                        <p style="color: #999;">加载中...</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 时间周期选择 -->
                <div class="control-section">
                    <h3>时间周期：</h3>
                    <div class="period-buttons">
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="30">近1月</button>
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="90">近3月</button>
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="180">近半年</button>
                        <button class="period-btn active" data-period="365">近1年</button>
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="1825">近5年</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- 操作按钮 -->
                <div class="control-section">
                    <button id="render-index-chart-btn" class="primary-btn">生成图表</button>
                    <button id="clear-index-selection-btn" class="secondary-btn">清除选择</button>
                    <span id="index-selected-count" style="margin-left: 15px; color: #666;">已选择: 0 个指数</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <!-- 图表容器 -->
            <div id="index-chart-container" style="width: 100%; height: 600px; margin-top: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100%; color: #99;">
                    请选择指数并点击"生成图表"按钮
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 基金统计页面 -->
        <div id="fund-monitor-page" class="page-content fund-full-width-panel">
            <h2>基金数据统计</h2>

            <!-- 基金排名控制 -->
            <div class="fund-controls">
                <button id="refresh-fund-ranking">刷新基金排名</button>
                <select id="fund-period-select">
                    <option value="1">最近1天</option>
                    <option value="5">最近5天</option>
                    <option value="10">最近10天</option>
                    <option value="20">最近20天</option>
                    <option value="30" selected>最近30天</option>
                    <option value="60">最近60天</option>
                    <option value="90">最近90天</option>
                    <option value="180">最近180天</option>
                    <option value="365">最近365天</option>
                </select>
                <select id="top-n-fund">
                    <option value="10">显示前10个</option>
                    <option value="28" selected>显示前28个</option>
                    <option value="40">显示前40个</option>
                    <option value="50">显示前50个</option>
                    <option value="100">显示前100个</option>
                    <option value="all">显示所有基金</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <div id="fund-ranking-container">
                <p>点击上方按钮加载基金数据...</p>
            </div>

            <!-- 基金对比图表 -->
            <h2>基金走势对比图（最近30天前28名）</h2>

            <!-- 基金选择区域 -->
            <div class="fund-chart-controls">
                <div class="control-section">
                    <h3>选择基金（最多10个）：</h3>
                    <div id="fund-checkboxes" class="checkboxes-grid">
                        <!-- 动态加载基金复选框 -->
                        <p style="color: #999;">加载中...</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 时间周期选择 -->
                <div class="control-section">
                    <h3>时间周期：</h3>
                    <div class="period-buttons">
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="30">近1月</button>
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="90">近3月</button>
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="180">近半年</button>
                        <button class="period-btn active" data-period="365">近1年</button>
                        <button class="period-btn" data-period="1825">近5年</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 操作按钮 -->
                <div class="control-section">
                    <button id="render-fund-chart-btn" class="primary-btn">生成图表</button>
                    <button id="clear-fund-selection-btn" class="secondary-btn">清除选择</button>
                    <span id="fund-selected-count" style="margin-left: 15px; color: #666;">已选择: 0 个基金</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 图表容器 -->
            <div id="fund-chart-container" style="width: 100%; height: 600px; margin-top: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 4px;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100%; color: #99;">
                    请选择基金并点击"生成图表"按钮
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div> <!-- container 结束 -->

